      {
        "id": 39953,
        "name": "Silverleaf",
        "username": "Silverleaf",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-26T20:58:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The Tachyon and AZ examples aren't&nbsp;<em>one</em> hit, and neither is Akash. Someone hitting themselves because you hit them (like Akash's limb self-harm) doesn't count as a single hit either.&nbsp;</p>",
