      {
        "id": 39954,
        "name": "McBehrer",
        "username": "McBehrer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-26T21:12:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>AZ was too one hit. It took several hits to build up to it, but once I was done preparing the Coolant Blast would have done 1 Target X Cold damage, where X is the amount of fire damage I'd taken. That total being an arbitrarily high number; because I was indestructible, I could have easily made it total 1,000,000 if I felt like it.</p>",
