      {
        "id": 39955,
        "name": "McBehrer",
        "username": "McBehrer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-26T21:16:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The infinite chain reaction of hitting myself for fire causing myself to hit myself for MORE fire would eventually cause me to hit myself for (one hit) of 1,000,000s of damage, which would cause me to deal one other target 1,000,000s of cold damage in a single hit. The question was what was the biggest single hit you've ever done; there was no rule saying I couldn't hit myself millions of times for consecutively stronger hits first to make the last one more powerful.</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:13:39.886Z",
