        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e68b1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-28T22:50:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I posted a short time ago with a very similar situlation. &nbsp;We were playing the new Gloom and Haka had Savage Mana-ed every target in his deck as well as a couple enviroment targets. &nbsp;He also had every card in his own deck played out or in his hand. &nbsp;When he finally let loose it was 18 cards under mana for 36 damage plus 33 cards in discarded to Haka of Battle for a total of 69 damage in one shot.</p>",
